' A v1.2 game with Amiga opponents (`preset classic ai amiga seed 86`), watched from
' Stove Vent, where the preset's draw starts the human: he does nothing but
' drink at the spring and end the day, so the opponents' hiring, camps, travel
' and duels are what changes the world. (Not Nob Hill: under v1.2 its radiation
' kills anybody not fully protected at the end of the first day.) He starves
' at about day 22; the run ends before.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 354,317         ' in
wait 60
mapclick 179,235         ' the spring
wait 40
esc
wait 10
